--- marketing/review-notes.md
## Claims in launch copy not supported by product spec

| # | Copy claim | Spec says | Issue |
|---|-----------|-----------|-------|
| 1 | "Works offline, anywhere" | "Offline support: removed in this release." | The spec states offline support is **removed** in this release; the copy claims it works offline. |
| 2 | "Export to PDF" | "Export: CSV only." | The spec says **CSV only**; the copy promises PDF export. |
| 3 | "Export to Excel" | "Export: CSV only." | The spec says **CSV only**; the copy promises Excel export. |

## Summary

Every substantive claim in the launch copy is unsupported. The spec describes a narrower product (no offline mode, CSV-only export), while the copy describes a broader one (offline-capable, multi-format export). All three lines of copy need revision to match spec v1.0.
